("v104", "type", "String")
("v104", "scalar", "Declared surface inventory plus automatic discovery of unclassified top-level cross browser writers. Catalogue rows check collection facts, selected-app notes, the view/serializer pipeline and cross content writer; they do not prove every inner renderer dependency. This is not exhaustive DOM, transitive dependency, visual or semantic verification. Threads and Map route rows additionally require generated destination headings, copy, artwork, reading links and identity return navigation across all forty readings in each world. These checks do not certify semantic or visual correctness.")
